<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan April consumer prices 11.45 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan April consumer prices 11.45 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's consumer price index rose 11.45 percent in April year-on-year compared with 11.82 percent in March and 11.03 percent in April 1996, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Monday.</p>
